        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin Estates Collection Door Levers 5105</b>\r\n<p>\r\nWith every touch, Baldwin hardware sends a message of quality and style \u0014throughout the life of your door. Baldwin quality, for an investment in your home that pays dividends for many years to come.\r\n<p>\r\nBaldwin innovations made solid forged brass the standard of excellence, and married style and security in pioneering Levers for virtually every important architectural style. Baldwin has created new finish options to deliver dozens, even hundreds of looks together with a consistent standard of fine brass.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specs and Features of Baldwin Estates Collection 5105 Door Lever:</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 1.938\"</li>\r\n<li>Length of lever from center mount to tip: 3.625\"</li>\r\n<li>Estate Series are solid forged brass for maximum strength and durability</li>\r\n<li>Available in 20 finishes\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>Levers are sold individually</b></p>",
